  "_comment": [
    "EdgeCDSS — drug lexicon for the free-text dose check.",
    "",
    "Names that are drugs but are NOT in drug_contracts.json. The free-text dose",
    "check (openai_client.free_text_dose_issues) recognises a drug from the",
    "contract bank or from this list; a mass dose stated beside a recognised",
    "drug with no signed contract dose is held (fail-closed). A word on neither",
    "list is not a drug to the check and passes.",
    "",
    "Recognition only. Nothing here is a dose, and nothing here can be served.",
    "Adding a drug to drug_contracts.json supersedes its entry here.",
    "",
    "jts_corpus_chunks: how many of the 8,559 corpus chunks name the drug or an",
    "alias, counted 2026-09-19. Evidence that the name occurs in the material the",
    "generator retrieves, not a filter: a drug the corpus never names is still",
    "listed, because a model can name it anyway."
  ],
